<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= subject %></title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #333333;
    }

    a {
      color: #2563eb;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .name {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #222222;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .role {
      color: #555555;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .contact {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555555;
    }
  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <div class="email-container">


<p>
  <% if (companyName && companyName !== 'your team') { %>
    Hi <%= companyName %> Talent Acquisition Team,
  <% } else { %>
    Hi Hiring Team,
  <% } %>
</p>

<p>
  I hope you are doing well.
</p>

<p>
  I am writing to express my interest in PHP/Laravel Developer opportunities at
  <strong><%= companyName || 'your organization' %></strong>
  <% if (location) { %>
    in <%= location %>
  <% } %>.
</p>

<p>
  I am currently working as a PHP/Laravel Developer at <strong>Minterminds</strong> with
  <strong><%= sender.yearsOfExp %></strong> of professional experience.
  My experience includes developing and maintaining web applications using PHP
  and Laravel, working with MySQL databases, developing and integrating REST APIs,
  debugging issues, and optimizing existing application functionality.
</p>

<% if (sender.skills) { %>
  <p>
    My key technical skills include
    <strong><%= sender.skills %></strong>.
  </p>
<% } %>

<p>
  I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss any current or upcoming
  positions that match my experience and skill set.
</p>

<p>
  Please find my profile and project links below for reference:
</p>

<p>
  <% if (sender.portfolio) { %>
    <a href="<%= sender.portfolio %>" target="_blank">Portfolio</a>
  <% } %>

  <% if (sender.portfolio && sender.linkedin) { %>
    &nbsp; | &nbsp;
  <% } %>

  <% if (sender.linkedin) { %>
    <a href="<%= sender.linkedin %>" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
  <% } %>

  <% if ((sender.portfolio || sender.linkedin) && sender.github) { %>
    &nbsp; | &nbsp;
  <% } %>

  <% if (sender.github) { %>
    <a href="<%= sender.github %>" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
  <% } %>
</p>

<p>
  Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.
</p>

<div class="signature">

  <p class="name">
    <%= sender.name %>
  </p>

  <!-- <p class="role">
    <%= sender.title %>
  </p> -->

  <p class="contact">

    <% if (sender.phone) { %>
      <%= sender.phone %>
    <% } %>

    <% if (sender.phone && sender.email) { %>
      &nbsp; | &nbsp;
    <% } %>

    <% if (sender.email) { %>
      <a href="mailto:<%= sender.email %>">
        <%= sender.email %>
      </a>
    <% } %>

  </p>

</div>


  </div>

</body>
</html>
